<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en-US">
<head>
	<meta charset="UTF-8">
	<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
	<title>{{ title or "Fight With Your Mind – You Cant Not Think" }}</title>
	<link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ '/css/style.css' | url }}">
	<link rel="icon" href="{{ '/uploads/2019/10/FWYM-Favicon-75x75.png' | url }}" sizes="32x32">
</head>
<body{% if "post-sidebar" in content %} class="has-post-sidebar"{% endif %}>

	<header id="header">
		<div id="headergrid">
			<a class="home-nav" href="/"><img src="{{ '/uploads/2020/07/home-nav.png' | url }}" class="nav" alt="current project"></a>
			<img src="{{ '/uploads/2019/10/logo.png' | url }}" class="header-logo" id="customlogo" alt="logo" title="logo" width="100%" height="auto">
			<a class="fighting-nav" href="/fighting"><img src="{{ '/uploads/2020/07/fighting-nav.png' | url }}" class="nav" alt="browse content"></a>
		</div>
		<div id="dummyheader">
			<a class="home-nav" href="/"><img src="{{ '/uploads/2020/07/home-nav.png' | url }}" class="nav" alt="current project"></a>
			<img src="{{ '/uploads/2019/10/logo.png' | url }}" class="header-logo" id="customlogo" alt="logo" title="logo" width="100%" height="auto">
			<a class="fighting-nav" href="/fighting"><img src="{{ '/uploads/2020/07/fighting-nav.png' | url }}" class="nav" alt="browse content"></a>
		</div>
	</header>

	<main id="main">
		<div class="tg-container">
			<div id="primary">
				{{ content | safe }}
			</div>
		</div>
	</main>

	<footer id="colophon">
		<div class="column">
			{% include "sidebar-boxes.njk" %}
		</div>

		<div id="footerbar">
			<h1 style="text-align: center; padding:1.5rem;">Fight With Your Mind is brought to you by Bootstrap Commercial Arts</h1>
			<p style="text-align: center; color:#ffffff;"><i>Fighting injustice with wide reaching visual, virtual, and verbal communication.</i></p>
			<div id="footer-2-col">
				<p>After spending time working in a marketing industry that capitalizes on the science and psychology of public manipulation, the former corporate marketers and founders of Bootstrap parted ways with big business.</p>
				<p>Bootstrap Commercial Arts, founder of the movement Fight With Your Mind, was created to better align a set of skills from the marketing industry with the concept that <i>marketing can be and should be about honesty and communication, and that people, not unaccountable entities, should be running our economy.</i></p>
				<p>Businesses should have products or services of value that are presented to demographics that possess an actual need, desire, or demand for what a business supplies. Marketers should facilitate that honest communication between the business and the public.</p>
				<p>Like any powerful tool, marketing can be misused, and people can be hurt and taken advantage of. Unfortunately, marketing has become synonymous with brainwashing at times, and the term <i>information warfare has become a threat that everyone should understand in order to protect themselves.</i></p>
			</div>
		</div>

		<div id="footer-divider">
			<h5><i>Fight With Your Mind</i> is one of 4 arms of Bootstrap Commercial Arts, all intended to fight injustice with commercial art. Learn more about Bootstrap and it's other arms of change:</h5>
		</div>

		<div class="footer-3-col">
			<div id="honestbox">
				<img src="{{ '/uploads/2020/03/honest-logo.png' | url }}">
				<p>Fighting dishonest marketing practices and information warfare by providing honesty to the public and honesty to the client.</p>
			</div>
			<div id="bootstrapsbox">
				<img src="{{ '/uploads/2020/03/bootstraps-logo.png' | url }}">
				<p>Fighting the injustice and inequality homeless endure by providing a four step program, a community and support group, resource center, training hub, and employment entry program that requires no government assistance, capital, or public monetary donation to operate.</p>
			</div>
			<div id="libralbox">
				<img src="{{ '/uploads/2020/03/LA-logo.png' | url }}">
				<p>Fighting the culture that drives information warfare through social media alternatives. Taking control of the future and not accepting a dire fate.</p>
			</div>
		</div>

		<div id="copyrightbar">
			<p style="text-align: center;">©2020 <a href="http://www.bythebootstrap.us" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="text-decoration:none; color:#ffffff;">Bootstrap Commercial Arts</a></p>
		</div>
	</footer>

</body>
</html>
